WEBVTT

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:05.768
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:10.040
Todoke Message

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:19.374
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:20.653
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:28.695
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.024
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:36.431
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:40.933
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:45.034
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:49.441
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:53.017
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:57.346
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:01.491
Todoke Message

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:09.995
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:14.373
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:18.574
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:28.477
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.927
Shurei Hong, the first woman in
Saiunkoku to pass the National Exams...

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.759
...and thirteen year old Eigetsu To...

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:41.357
...the youngest candidate
in history to pass...

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:45.803
...have been met with harsh treatment
in their training as new officials.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:52.201
However, "There are no demons
in this world".

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:59.817
There are unmistakably people around
them warmly looking over them.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:07.682
There Are No Demons in this World

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:19.963
You're here again?!

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:25.468
I said I would guard you, didn't I?

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:28.139
Just who do
you think you are?!

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.614
What's wrong with having
Seiran guard us instead?

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.213
- Can't do that.
- Why not?!

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:35.584
Seiran is just a granary guard.

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:39.120
His position doesn't qualify him
to serve as a personal guard.

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:45.457
While I'm sure he worries about you,
there are things he can and cannot do.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.464
But even so, why should you...?

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:52.596
This is the most dangerous time
for the two of you.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:55.402
You have no rank or status,
and basically no support.

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:57.943
If you suddenly disappeared, nobody
would even bother to look into it.

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:01.469
Are you suggesting that
our lives might be in danger?

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:03.539
In the worst case, yes.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.813
There are people
all over the place...

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:07.978
...who would not hesitate
to take another's life...

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:10.181
...simply because they don't like them.

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:13.248
There was strong opposition to admitting
female officials, right from the start...

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:15.191
...and that hasn't changed
much even now.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:18.230
But, me aside,
what about Eigetsu?

00:03:18.565 --> 00:03:21.966
Eigetsu has rejected every marriage
proposal offered to him by noble families.

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:24.762
A few people placing
particular importance on rank...

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.135
...are angry that some newly conferred
official dare reject them.

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:29.869
But there's no need to worry.

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:32.673
As your personal guard,
I will diligently protect you.

00:03:34.047 --> 00:03:37.312
It's less convincing hearing that from
someone with rice stuck to their cheek.

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:52.929
Although it's a regular occurrence
every year...

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:55.729
...I can't help but be amazed with the
pileups in your room this time of year.

00:03:56.636 --> 00:04:00.697
Do they really think that sending bribes
will make me look favorably on them?

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:03.637
They just don't have the guts to await
a legitimate outcome.

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:07.337
People believe you and Secretary Kou
have the final word...

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:10.109
...on promotions and demotions, after all.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.880
I wouldn't mind it as much if they
bribed me with material goods.

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:15.088
Whether I sell them or use them
as proof of bribery...

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:16.953
...they're still of some use to me.

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:20.424
Aha. So you've been receiving
a bunch of those again?

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:21.460
The marriage proposals?

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:23.688
Good lord! How many times
do I have to say...

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.731
...I hate women to
get it into their heads?

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:28.829
It's simply ridiculous in the first place
to even think that a marriage proposal...

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:30.869
...is going to get anyone a promotion!

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:33.736
Huh? This girl.

00:04:35.008 --> 00:04:36.202
Interesting, isn't it?

00:04:36.276 --> 00:04:38.141
Interesting indeed.

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:42.079
But to think he'd still offer you
his daughter's hand in marriage...

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:45.083
...after what you and the Senior
Secretary of Civil Affairs put him through.

00:04:45.151 --> 00:04:47.847
That man continues to show us
just how thick-skinned he is.

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:05.931
Watch out!

00:05:21.454 --> 00:05:23.422
That incident was a scary reminder...

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:26.287
...of why you'd never want to become
a target of Reishin Hong.

00:05:27.093 --> 00:05:31.587
But I must say he has guts to still wear
a wig as if nothing had ever happened.

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:35.258
So? Isn't there something
you wanted to talk to me about?

00:05:35.335 --> 00:05:37.303
Ah, that's right.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:40.703
I received a letter from Ensei saying
that he's left Sa Province.

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:42.900
He should arrive in about
one and a half months.

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:46.711
That girl, Korin is with him.

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:48.744
Korin?

00:05:49.082 --> 00:05:50.777
Apparently she wants
to personally report...

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.545
...what's been going on within
the Sa family.

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:55.746
And she also wants to see Shurei.

00:05:57.657 --> 00:05:59.989
What do you suggest we do?
Shurei doesn't know...

00:06:00.059 --> 00:06:02.994
...the real reason why
Korin left for Sa Province.

00:06:03.262 --> 00:06:06.595
That, in trying to help Advisor Sa,
she poisoned Shurei...

00:06:06.666 --> 00:06:08.395
...and attempted to take her life.

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:15.469
What reason is there to hesitate?

00:06:16.743 --> 00:06:18.768
Circumstances have changed since then.

00:06:18.845 --> 00:06:21.279
Shurei is an official now.

00:06:21.347 --> 00:06:23.645
This is something
she must come to accept.

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:27.618
I agree. My thoughts, exactly.

00:06:29.622 --> 00:06:34.218
Well, I'll be going then. I've been
pretty busy too, with other matters.

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:36.327
Other matters?

00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:37.363
Yeah.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.630
Th-There's no end to this.

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:44.499
No, there's no end to this,
is there?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.197
These are going to the
Department of Public Works...

00:06:46.272 --> 00:06:47.466
...these to the Department of Justice...

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.839
...these are for the Department
of Protocol, and... um...!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.812
Last year's budget balance of the
Department of Protocol is... well...!

00:06:54.881 --> 00:06:57.850
- The breakdown of the top officials'...!
- You're working hard at this late hour.

00:06:59.018 --> 00:06:59.985
Not again.

00:07:00.052 --> 00:07:03.021
Your work ethic is admirable,
simply admirable.

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:05.853
Well then, take care of these
as well, won't you?

00:07:06.225 --> 00:07:11.390
To you, this work should be
as easy as playing a simple game.

00:07:11.464 --> 00:07:12.431
Here!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.963
I, myself, am very busy, as you know.
Have it finished today.

00:07:24.477 --> 00:07:26.968
Would it not be wise
to dispose of this man?

00:07:29.749 --> 00:07:31.717
No, it would not be wise.

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:34.583
That bastard!

00:07:34.654 --> 00:07:38.146
He always purposely dirties the floor as
soon as I'm finished cleaning the toilets!

00:07:38.224 --> 00:07:39.623
Why is he so conceited?!

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:42.855
I heard in the toilets that he only got
his current position by pulling strings!

00:07:43.463 --> 00:07:45.590
Official Wa of the
Department of Protocol, right?

00:07:45.865 --> 00:07:48.265
He often comes to have
his shoes polished as well...

00:07:48.334 --> 00:07:50.825
...after going to the trouble
of getting them really dirty.

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:55.006
Are you all right
with those calculations?

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:57.042
You were dealing with really
large figures.

00:07:57.376 --> 00:08:00.004
I still remember the figures
I calculated moments ago.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:03.510
On the other hand,
you have to sort those files again.

00:08:04.684 --> 00:08:07.244
Humans are creatures
that learn from experience.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:10.380
I marked all the documents
which I have already sorted.

00:08:13.326 --> 00:08:14.293
Hi.

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:18.261
Is everything all right?
Why don't I make you some tea?

00:08:19.098 --> 00:08:22.431
You stay back, Father!
If we drink that tea that you make...

00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:25.471
...we'll lose every ounce of energy
we have left, and end up in heaven!

00:08:25.638 --> 00:08:26.832
That was mean.

00:08:26.906 --> 00:08:29.374
That aside,
why are you still here?

00:08:29.442 --> 00:08:31.876
Seiran's all alone at home.

00:08:31.944 --> 00:08:36.881
Oh, well...
I still have work to take care of.

00:08:37.383 --> 00:08:39.351
I couldn't go home even
if I wanted to.

00:08:59.739 --> 00:09:01.707
All right.
I'm gonna go and deliver these.

00:09:02.341 --> 00:09:04.309
Okay. See you later.

00:09:14.287 --> 00:09:16.084
Today, too?

00:09:16.155 --> 00:09:17.520
Yeah.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:19.758
Today's tea is Ryusen tea.

00:09:20.192 --> 00:09:22.353
It's a tea said to relieve fatigue.

00:09:22.762 --> 00:09:26.220
I don't know who's doing this, but
it's certainly nice to receive it everyday.

00:09:26.299 --> 00:09:27.857
Yes it is.

00:09:28.134 --> 00:09:30.125
I'll have some when
I get back.

00:09:30.202 --> 00:09:31.669
You go ahead
and help yourself.

00:09:31.737 --> 00:09:32.863
Okay.

00:09:38.344 --> 00:09:40.312
Next, the Department of Protocol.

00:09:44.917 --> 00:09:46.885
A hit! A hit!

00:09:49.589 --> 00:09:53.025
Honestly! A woman running around
is such an eyesore!

00:09:53.092 --> 00:09:56.289
Resorting to childish bullying.
Are they stupid?

00:09:57.029 --> 00:09:58.496
Oops!

00:10:02.168 --> 00:10:03.294
Huh?

00:10:08.107 --> 00:10:10.098
It seems a strange game
has become popular...

00:10:10.176 --> 00:10:13.202
...within the Department of Protocol,
doesn't it, Secretary Sai?

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:15.372
Wh-What on earth are you doing?!

00:10:15.448 --> 00:10:17.541
Just what is going on here?!

00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:20.552
P-Please excuse us.
It was Official Ro's...!

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.417
Official Ro?

00:10:22.488 --> 00:10:26.151
This is all because I failed to
supervise them adequately!

00:10:26.559 --> 00:10:31.087
Well now, speak of the devil.
If it isn't Official Ro.

00:10:35.301 --> 00:10:37.599
What are you doing, Initiate Hong?

00:10:38.304 --> 00:10:41.068
You have time to be taking a break
in a place like this?

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:42.232
No, what happened is...!

00:10:42.308 --> 00:10:44.401
Seeing that you have
all this time to spare...

00:10:44.477 --> 00:10:46.843
...I'm putting you in charge of
cleaning this area.

00:10:46.912 --> 00:10:49.403
- But...!
- Do you have any objections?!

00:10:55.187 --> 00:10:57.485
From here on in, you're on your own.

00:10:57.556 --> 00:10:59.751
Don't count on any help
from me or Shuei.

00:11:16.509 --> 00:11:17.737
Seiran.

00:11:19.912 --> 00:11:21.743
- My La...
- No. Go away.

00:11:22.615 --> 00:11:25.743
When it comes to this,
I can't rely on any help from others.

00:11:26.619 --> 00:11:30.919
Not you, or father either.
This was my decision.

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:33.458
I took this path out of
my own desire, after all.

00:11:33.626 --> 00:11:36.618
No matter what happens,
I can't rely on anyone else's help.

00:11:37.096 --> 00:11:40.293
I'm... really very happy.

00:11:41.033 --> 00:11:44.025
I've managed to realize a dream
that I never imagined would come true.

00:11:44.103 --> 00:11:48.005
Up until now, I've always burdened you
with my complaints and cried to you...

00:11:48.074 --> 00:11:52.340
...but I won't this time.
I can't let you spoil me, Seiran.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.145
Please go while
I've got my eyes closed!

00:12:01.787 --> 00:12:06.019
If you ever feel you can't take it anymore,
please come to me.

00:12:07.059 --> 00:12:10.358
Not for your sake, My Lady,
but for mine.

00:12:13.599 --> 00:12:15.430
You can't go over there!

00:12:15.501 --> 00:12:19.597
If she can't get through this on her own,
no one will ever acknowledge her!

00:12:19.972 --> 00:12:21.769
She didn't even accept Seiran's help.

00:12:21.841 --> 00:12:24.969
If the king protects her, all of her efforts
up until now will go to waste!

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:31.541
Do you think Shurei
will become a good official?

00:12:31.817 --> 00:12:34.786
If Shurei can continue
the way she is now, it's likely.

00:12:34.854 --> 00:12:39.154
I see. Even as an official,
Shurei is still Shurei.

00:12:39.225 --> 00:12:44.026
I want to have that Shurei by my side.
Do you think that's possible?

00:12:44.697 --> 00:12:47.063
Well, that really depends on Shurei.

00:12:47.299 --> 00:12:50.826
If she can become an official with
everyone's approval, maybe it is.

00:12:51.771 --> 00:12:55.172
- It'll be a long process, won't it?
- That all depends on her, and on you.

00:12:56.108 --> 00:12:59.009
- Will I be able to wait that long?
- Good question.

00:12:59.411 --> 00:13:01.072
But considering that you respected
Shurei's feelings...

00:13:01.147 --> 00:13:02.409
...about the Royal Exams...

00:13:02.481 --> 00:13:06.918
...and waited a whole year without
making a move, I'd say it's possible.

00:13:11.957 --> 00:13:16.917
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:13:27.173 --> 00:13:29.334
Shurei Hong,
reporting for duty.

00:13:29.975 --> 00:13:32.671
Eigetsu To here. Good morning.

00:13:33.145 --> 00:13:35.807
You finished all your work,
I presume?

00:13:36.549 --> 00:13:38.176
- Yes.
- We're finished.

00:13:43.122 --> 00:13:44.146
Official Ro.

00:13:44.223 --> 00:13:46.384
Having worked all night
for several days straight...

00:13:46.458 --> 00:13:48.392
...these two are
extremely exhausted.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:51.793
I think you should allow them
to rest for a while in another room.

00:13:52.631 --> 00:13:54.394
Well then, Initiate Heki.

00:13:54.466 --> 00:13:58.493
Would you like to take up cleaning toilets
and polishing shoes in their place?

00:13:59.438 --> 00:14:04.899
Fine. I will. Well then, I will take these
two to the sleeping quarters.

00:14:04.977 --> 00:14:06.069
Excuse me.

00:14:14.854 --> 00:14:16.822
Um, thank you.

00:14:17.089 --> 00:14:19.148
Thank you very much, Hakumei.

00:14:20.159 --> 00:14:21.524
I don't want you to misunderstand.

00:14:21.594 --> 00:14:23.721
I'm only doing this because if you
were to collapse from exhaustion...

00:14:23.796 --> 00:14:25.787
...you'd end up causing trouble
for the rest of us.

00:14:25.865 --> 00:14:28.425
I suggest you get some quality sleep.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.879
Female officials? What a joke!

00:14:41.013 --> 00:14:43.880
Like you, women should just focus on
serving men, pleasuring them...

00:14:43.949 --> 00:14:45.712
...and staying home
behaving themselves.

00:14:45.784 --> 00:14:47.752
Who does she think she is...

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:51.119
...being a smart ass by trying to get
involved in governmental affairs?!

00:14:51.423 --> 00:14:53.391
My, how scary.

00:14:54.326 --> 00:14:56.157
Say, my lord.

00:14:56.762 --> 00:15:00.095
That little box you have. Does it contain
what you said you lost the other day?

00:15:00.299 --> 00:15:02.233
That still hasn't been found.

00:15:02.301 --> 00:15:05.270
My. But that was such a valuable ring.

00:15:06.171 --> 00:15:10.699
I had several copies made in case
the real one never shows up.

00:15:10.776 --> 00:15:12.710
I think this one is the closest
to the original.

00:15:13.379 --> 00:15:15.973
You're certainly attached to it.

00:15:17.249 --> 00:15:19.979
This is the hen that lays golden eggs.

00:15:20.052 --> 00:15:22.418
If I can convince them
that this is the real one...

00:15:22.488 --> 00:15:25.548
...not only will I be promoted several
ranks, I'll have a lot of money coming in.

00:15:25.624 --> 00:15:28.092
Oh, I know!
If everything works out...

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:32.358
...this might even give me the opportunity
to get rid of that annoying female official!

00:15:32.765 --> 00:15:36.531
And what's more, that little girl's
sponsor is Reishin Hong.

00:15:37.169 --> 00:15:38.864
This would work out perfectly...

00:15:38.938 --> 00:15:41.406
...if I could also use this
to bring about his downfall.

00:15:41.941 --> 00:15:46.105
Kocho. I may be asking you
for some help, too.

00:15:47.913 --> 00:15:49.904
As you wish, my lord.

00:15:53.252 --> 00:15:55.618
This is not the same
as the one Advisor Sa had.

00:15:55.688 --> 00:15:59.215
Right. This is likely one of the
several copies that man made...

00:15:59.291 --> 00:16:01.759
...in order to replace the real one
that was lost.

00:16:02.027 --> 00:16:04.359
Apparently one of his subordinates
needed the money...

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:06.159
...and sold it on the black market.

00:16:06.231 --> 00:16:11.692
But I wonder, is the ring that idiot initially
found and lost right away the real one...

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.738
...signifying leadership
of the Sa family?

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:18.269
After Advisor Sa's death, we searched
for an entire year to no avail.

00:16:18.344 --> 00:16:21.939
Why has it turned up now?
The timing is too convenient.

00:16:22.548 --> 00:16:28.214
It certainly is unsettling. It's almost
as if another power is at work here.

00:16:28.887 --> 00:16:32.550
What would you like to do? Should we
resume the search for the real ring?

00:16:33.359 --> 00:16:36.692
I think so. Please continue the search,
just in case.

00:16:36.996 --> 00:16:39.931
What about the Department of Protocol,
when should we make an arrest?

00:16:39.999 --> 00:16:41.830
We have conclusive evidence.

00:16:42.768 --> 00:16:45.965
We'll wait a little longer.
This is a critical period.

00:16:49.041 --> 00:16:50.531
Excuse me!

00:16:50.909 --> 00:16:55.141
I'm Shurei Hong.
I'm here to deliver these documents.

00:17:01.887 --> 00:17:05.015
I must say, she works really hard
for a woman, doesn't she?

00:17:05.924 --> 00:17:10.452
I heard that some are sending bribes to
Official Ro to get their workload reduced.

00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:12.656
In comparison, she's really got guts.

00:17:12.731 --> 00:17:14.824
She's full of energy,
and always smiling.

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:18.358
It may be nice to have
a female official around.

00:17:25.978 --> 00:17:28.105
For some reason this
isn't quite right.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:33.847
I also have something that looks
a bit odd. Please take a look at it.

00:17:34.353 --> 00:17:36.548
Then Eigetsu, would you
take a look at this?

00:17:40.192 --> 00:17:42.160
This is... the same department?

00:17:42.995 --> 00:17:44.963
Both involve the
Department of Protocol.

00:17:46.198 --> 00:17:49.634
Hey. Why don't we write about this
for that report Official Ro assigned us?

00:17:49.968 --> 00:17:52.664
Yes, that sounds like a good idea!

00:17:52.738 --> 00:17:55.366
He did say we're free to write about
whatever we want.

00:17:55.841 --> 00:17:59.004
All right, let's put something together
once we finish our work.

00:17:59.078 --> 00:18:02.445
Don't tell me you're planning on doing
more, after finishing all this work!

00:18:04.917 --> 00:18:07.977
Hakumei. You've come to
help us again today?

00:18:08.053 --> 00:18:09.953
I'm not doing it for you two!

00:18:10.022 --> 00:18:13.822
Like I told you, if you collapse,
it will cause trouble for others!

00:18:15.494 --> 00:18:18.258
You know, we're really thankful that
you've been helping us with our work...

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:19.729
...but are you really
okay with this?

00:18:19.798 --> 00:18:22.562
I hear that Official Ro now
has his eye on you...

00:18:22.634 --> 00:18:24.659
...and has increased your workload.

00:18:28.073 --> 00:18:31.042
That amount of work is nothing.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:32.168
Listen up!

00:18:32.244 --> 00:18:34.974
My role model is Koyu Ri!

00:18:35.314 --> 00:18:37.407
He became an Assistant Secretary
and the king's personal aide...

00:18:37.483 --> 00:18:38.780
...at an incredibly young age.

00:18:38.851 --> 00:18:41.251
He's a living example of the capability of
the human mind, who will no doubt...

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:42.912
...become the youngest
prime minister in history!

00:18:42.988 --> 00:18:46.890
Cool and composed,
incredibly intelligent, sharp and decisive.

00:18:46.959 --> 00:18:50.156
- He is an iron wall of reasoning!
- Though he tends to get lost easily.

00:18:50.229 --> 00:18:51.992
Though he often loses his temper.

00:18:52.364 --> 00:18:54.832
He's so worthy of my respect!

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:58.201
I'd be happy to get even a step closer
to being like Koyu!

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:01.637
In fact, it would not be an exaggeration
to say I want to become Koyu!

00:19:03.008 --> 00:19:04.498
S-Say...!

00:19:05.644 --> 00:19:07.839
Is the rumor true about
you postponing your chance...

00:19:07.913 --> 00:19:09.278
...to take the National Exams...

00:19:09.348 --> 00:19:11.748
...for one year out of respect for Koyu,
who earned his Jogen title...

00:19:11.817 --> 00:19:13.045
...at age sixteen?

00:19:13.218 --> 00:19:15.209
Is there anything wrong with that
if it is true?

00:19:15.287 --> 00:19:19.121
But then, after waiting an extra year until
I turned seventeen to take the Exams...

00:19:19.291 --> 00:19:21.259
...some thirteen year old
easygoing little animal...

00:19:21.326 --> 00:19:23.556
...comes along
and grabs the Jogen title.

00:19:23.629 --> 00:19:26.120
Some weirdo from the Ran family
takes Bogen.

00:19:26.632 --> 00:19:30.568
And Tanka is taken by a little girl,
leaving me with fourth place!

00:19:30.636 --> 00:19:34.834
Something's wrong with this picture!
You really screwed up my plans!

00:19:35.307 --> 00:19:38.333
But I won't let you
ruin my dreams any further.

00:19:38.777 --> 00:19:42.008
I'll be moving forward on the road to
success riding purely on my own ability.

00:19:43.482 --> 00:19:46.645
I understand that's the path
Koyu had to take.

00:19:46.885 --> 00:19:50.377
To find myself in the same situation
can only be explained as fate!

00:19:50.455 --> 00:19:52.616
There's no way I'm giving up!

00:19:52.691 --> 00:19:54.750
Just wait. Within a few years...

00:19:54.826 --> 00:19:56.191
...I'll advance to a higher rank
than Official Ro.

00:19:56.261 --> 00:19:58.855
Then I'll be the one looking down
on him and ordering him around!

00:20:00.165 --> 00:20:02.429
Anyway, you two, get back to work.

00:20:02.501 --> 00:20:04.560
Tomorrow is the one day off we get
during the week.

00:20:04.636 --> 00:20:07.127
If you don't finish, you'll end up having
to work on your day off again, you know!

00:20:07.206 --> 00:20:09.504
- Yes!
- Right, let's get back to it!

00:20:16.715 --> 00:20:18.546
Good morning, Father.

00:20:18.617 --> 00:20:19.845
Good morning.

00:20:20.285 --> 00:20:21.843
Good morning.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:25.356
You can sleep in longer if you want.
Today's your day off, isn't it?

00:20:25.757 --> 00:20:27.884
I can't sleep the whole day away.

00:20:29.361 --> 00:20:32.262
Oh, right. A letter arrived for you.

00:20:33.131 --> 00:20:34.598
And for you too, Eigetsu.

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.958
For me, too?

00:20:37.035 --> 00:20:40.198
It's probably a response to that letter
you sent home, don't you think?

00:20:53.051 --> 00:20:55.178
What? That money I sent.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:58.182
The Department of Protocol
courier hasn't arrived?

00:20:58.257 --> 00:20:59.554
How could that be?

00:20:59.625 --> 00:21:01.183
Eigetsu!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:03.691
Let's go out this afternoon.

00:21:03.762 --> 00:21:06.230
Miss Kocho has invited us
to pay her a visit!

00:21:07.799 --> 00:21:10.267
- We'll be on our way.
- Have fun.

00:21:14.606 --> 00:21:18.474
Good of you to come. I've been waiting,
wondering when you would.

00:21:18.543 --> 00:21:20.977
I never imagined an estate of a direct
descendant of the Hong family...

00:21:21.046 --> 00:21:23.674
...would be so rundown, without
even a guard at the gate.

00:21:25.684 --> 00:21:27.675
Long time no see, Kuro.

00:21:30.822 --> 00:21:33.689
Yes, it's been a while, big brother.

00:21:37.529 --> 00:21:38.689
Hey, have you heard?

00:21:38.764 --> 00:21:41.164
Apparently there was improper conduct
involved in the National Examinations.

00:21:41.233 --> 00:21:43.929
Yeah, I heard that rumor too.

00:21:44.136 --> 00:21:46.696
Something about Reishin Hong
of the Department of Civil Affairs...

00:21:46.772 --> 00:21:48.637
...manipulating things behind
the scenes in order...

00:21:48.707 --> 00:21:50.231
...to let that woman
pass the exams.

00:21:50.309 --> 00:21:52.436
To think that Senior Secretary Hong
would do such a thing.

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:58.213
Shurei has only been absent a day...

00:21:58.283 --> 00:22:00.717
...and the entire atmosphere
around the palace has changed.

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:03.085
Yes.

00:22:03.155 --> 00:22:05.282
A strange rumor is going around.

00:22:05.624 --> 00:22:08.092
It would appear that someone
is spreading it intentionally.

00:22:09.127 --> 00:22:11.618
It seems we have some
uninvited guests.

00:22:11.697 --> 00:22:14.097
I'll leave you to do what
has to be done from here on.

00:22:14.166 --> 00:22:15.133
Yes.

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:21.366
Y-You are under suspicion of improper
conduct concerning the National Exams.

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:24.375
Secretary Hong, we are here
to take you into custody.

00:22:25.143 --> 00:22:28.112
Though I expected it,
using tactics like this?

00:22:28.847 --> 00:22:31.680
Ah, imprisonment, is it?
Very well.

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:34.810
Take me away if you must.
I'll allow you to place me under arrest.

00:22:35.454 --> 00:22:39.982
But don't blame me for what might
happen to you guys as a result.

00:22:41.727 --> 00:22:44.423
To tarnish everything that girl worked
so desperately to achieve...

00:22:44.496 --> 00:22:47.192
...purely out of greed.

00:23:03.515 --> 00:23:05.210
Miss Kocho!

00:23:05.283 --> 00:23:07.183
Thank you for coming!

00:23:07.252 --> 00:23:09.550
It's been quite a while.

00:23:09.621 --> 00:23:12.454
Not since you passed
the National Exams, isn't it?

00:23:21.266 --> 00:23:22.563
Miss Kocho?

00:23:30.509 --> 00:23:35.606
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.814 --> 00:23:42.151
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.454 --> 00:23:47.414
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.626 --> 00:23:52.723
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.732 --> 00:23:58.135
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.671 --> 00:24:04.802
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.577 --> 00:24:16.146
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.022 --> 00:24:22.619
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.028 --> 00:24:28.091
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:28.967 --> 00:24:34.530
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.906 --> 00:24:41.709
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.450 --> 00:24:47.652
Next Episode
